    <description>DIR-868. Fires when a Quote is linked to a Contract (ContractId set). (1) Links the contract back to the quote - Contract.RES_Quote_Id__c and, if blank, SourceQuoteId. (2) Carries the Unit line's business discount forward to the Unit CIP row: RES_Discount_Type__c (Trade Discount / Early Settlement) from the unit QuoteLineItem and RES_Discount_Amount__c = the line's discount amount (Subtotal - TotalPrice). Standard DiscountType/DiscountValue are left blank - DiscountType only accepts AdjustmentPercentage/AdjustmentAmount and the platform forces the two standard fields to be set or cleared together. Both parts are idempotent.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>fDiscountAmount</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>IF(
    OR(ISBLANK({!Get_Unit_QLI.Subtotal}), ISBLANK({!Get_Unit_QLI.TotalPrice})),
    0,
    {!Get_Unit_QLI.Subtotal} - {!Get_Unit_QLI.TotalPrice}
)</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
